  "prose": [
    {
      "title": "Controlled",
      "text": "To control component state provide `value` and `onChange` props:",
      "format": "md"
    },
    {
      "title": "Siblings",
      "text": "Control number of active item siblings with `siblings` prop:",
      "format": "md"
    },
    {
      "title": "Boundaries",
      "text": "Control number of items displayed after previous and before next buttons with `boundaries` prop:",
      "format": "md"
    },
    {
      "title": "Hide pages controls",
      "text": "Set `withPages={false}` to hide pages controls:",
      "format": "md"
    },
    {
      "title": "Compound components",
      "text": "You can use the following compound components to have full control over the `Pagination` rendering:\n\n- `Pagination.Root` – context provider\n- `Pagination.Items` – items list\n- `Pagination.Next` – next control\n- `Pagination.Previous` – previous control\n- `Pagination.First` – first control\n- `Pagination.Last` – last control",
      "format": "md"
    },
    {
      "title": "use-pagination hook",
      "text": "If you need more flexibility `@mantine/hooks` package exports [use-pagination](/hooks/use-pagination/) hook,\nyou can use it to create custom pagination components.",
      "format": "md"
    }
  ],
